Lamnso Care Agent - H-MEM engine
================================
engines/hmem/src/**, engines/hmem/conformance/** and engines/hmem/LICENSE come from the Meterless project
(https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless, engines/hmem), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Copied unchanged: src/*.ts (the runnable reference implementation of the H-MEM spec), conformance/vectors/.
One-line change: conformance/runner.ts - the default implementation path now points at this repo's
engines/hmem/index.ts (the HMEM_IMPL environment variable still overrides it, exactly as upstream).

Written for this project (hackathon build window): index.ts, care.ts, server.ts, test/*.

Second change to upstream code: src/embeddings.ts. embed() is replaced by a deterministic, offline, care-domain
embedder (concept axes for anxiety / sleep / low mood / loneliness / ... plus hashed stems). The H-MEM spec makes
the embedder swappable, and the upstream README says the hash mock is meant to be replaced. tokenize(), cosine()
and jaccard() are unchanged. The original is the file engines/hmem/reference in the Meterless repository.
